#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:81
msgid "API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:83
msgid ""
"The API is built around the `RpcProvider` class. A `RpcProvider` acts "
"both as client and server for RPC calls and event-like signals. The "
"library uses ES6 promises and can consume any A+ compliant promises."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:87
msgid "Creating a new provider"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:91
msgid ""
"`dispatcher`: A function that will be called for dispatching messages. "
"The  first argument will be an opaque message object, and the second "
"argument  an error of `Transferable` objects that are to be passed via "
"ownership  transfer (if supported by the transport)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:95
msgid ""
"`timeout` (optional): The timeout for RPC transactions in milliseconds.  "
"Values of `0` or smaller disable the timeout (this is the default)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:98
msgid "Incoming messages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:102
msgid ""
"Similar to message dispatch, `worker-rpc` does not provide a built-in "
"mechanism for receiving messages. Instead, incoming messages must be "
"relayed to the provider by invoking `dispatch`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:106
msgid "`message`: The received message."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:108
msgid "Registering RPC handlers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:112
msgid ""
"Register a handler function for RPC calls with id `id`. Returns the "
"provider instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:114
msgid ""
"`id`: RPC call id. Only a single handler can be registered for any id. "
"Ids should  be strings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:116
msgid ""
"`handler`: The handler function. This function receives the payload "
"object as  its argument and can return its result either as an immediate "
"value or as a   promise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:120
msgid "Registering signal handlers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:124
msgid ""
"Register a handler function for signals with id `id`. Returns the "
"provider instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:126
msgid ""
"`id`: Signal id. The namespace for signal ids is seperate from that of "
"RPC ids,  and multiple handlers my be attached tp a single signal. Ids "
"should be strings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:128
msgid ""
"`handler`: The handler function. This function receives the payload "
"object as  its argument; the result is ignored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:131
msgid "Dispatching RPC calls"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:135
msgid ""
"Dispatch a RPC call and returns a promise for its result. The promise is "
"rejected if the call times out or if no handler is registered (or if the "
"handler rejects the operation)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:139
msgid "`id`: RPC call id."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:140
msgid "`payload` (optional): RPC call payload."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:141 ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:152
msgid ""
"`transfer` (optional): List of `Transferables` that will be passed to "
"dispatched (see above)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:144
msgid "Dispatching signals"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:148
msgid "Dispatch a signal. Returns the provider instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:150
msgid "`id`: Signal id."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:151
msgid "`payload` (optional): Signal payload."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:155
msgid "Deregistering RPC handlers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:159
msgid ""
"`id` and `handler` must be the same arguments used for "
"`registerRpcHandler`. Returns the provider instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:162
msgid "Deregistering signal handlers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:166
msgid ""
"`id` and `handler` must be the same arguments used for "
"`registerSignalHandler`. Returns the provider instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:169
msgid "Errors"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/worker-rpc_README.md:173
msgid ""
"The error event is dispatched if there is either a local or remote "
"communcation error (timeout, invalid id, etc.). Checkout the "
"[microevent.ts](https://github.com/DirtyHairy/microevent) documentation "
"for the event API."
msgstr ""

